activity Plan Integration
activity Design System Architecture
activity Develop Integration Components
activity Configure Integration Environment
activity Test Integration
activity Deploy Integration
activity Monitor System Performance
activity Resolve Integration Issues
activity Document Integration Process
activity Train Users
activity Review Integration Plan
activity Approve Integration Design
activity Validate Integration Results
