activity Gather User Feedback
bind Plan Integration: Integration ID, Integration Status
bind Design System Architecture: Integration ID, Integration Type
bind Test Integration: Testing Result, Testing Coverage
bind Deploy Integration: Integration Status, Downtime
bind Resolve Integration Issues: Number of Errors, Integration Status
Integration ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Integration Cost: float between 100.0 and 100000.0
Integration Status: Planned, In Progress, Completed, Failed
Number of Systems: integer between 2 and 10
Downtime: float between 0.0 and 24.0
Integration Type: Data, Application, Process
Team Size: integer between 1 and 20
Testing Coverage: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Testing Result: Passed, Failed, Partial
Number of Errors: integer between 0 and 100
Init[Plan Integration] | |
End[Deploy Integration] | |
Precedence[Develop Integration Components, Design System Architecture] | | |
Response[Develop Integration Components, Test Integration] | | |
Succession[Test Integration, Deploy Integration] | | |
Chain Response[Deploy Integration, Monitor System Performance] | | |
Alternate Response[Monitor System Performance, Resolve Integration Issues] | | |
Responded Existence[Plan Integration, Document Integration Process] | | |
Co-Existence[Train Users, Deploy Integration] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Review Integration Plan, Approve Integration Design] | | |
Not Precedence[Validate Integration Results, Approve Integration Design] | | |
Not Response[Update System Documentation, Gather User Feedback] | | |
Choice[Plan Integration, Design System Architecture] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Test Integration, Deploy Integration] | | |
